            <Line>Switching losses (Eon and Eoff) are given in Figures 21 and 22 in the datasheet for Vdd = 1000V and 1200V, respectively, and for Tj = 25C, and Rg = 8Ω. The data is then scaled based on the user-specified value of Rg using the data in Figure 23, as well as the measured junction temperature during the simulation, using the data in Figure 25 (note that Eoff is not affected by temperature).</Line>
